# A group inserted mid-history (C4): a rectangle extruded, its sketch made
# active on the home screen, and a second extrusion made there goes in
# between the sketch and the first extrusion, as the home screen lists;
# the later extrusion still regenerates, and Check Solid finds the solid
# of the history up to the active group.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
twmove 28 10
twdown L 28 10
twup L 28 10
twmove 28 135
twdown L 28 135
twup L 28 135
key x shift
twmove 28 10
twdown L 28 10
twup L 28 10
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
